{"meta":{"id":"cee:1019570","type":"series","name":"Alps Stories: My Annette","poster":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/47026027-7B01-4412-1CBF-E9CD6E89C896_poster.jpg","background":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/47026027-7B01-4412-1CBF-E9CD6E89C896_poster.jpg","description":"ولدت أنيت البالغة من العمر 12 عامًا في عائلة فقيرة في سويسرا. تعيش مع عائلتها في قرية صغيرة في جبال الألب. إنها فتاة لطيفة وتحب بشدة شقيقها الصغير داني البالغ من العمر 5 سنوات، والذي توفيت والدتهما عند ولادته. لديها أيضًا أفضل صديق، لوسيان. تصل صداقتها الرائعة معه إلى أزمة عندما تصاب داني ذات يوم في حادث مروع","releaseInfo":"1983","genres":["رسوم متحركة","دراما","شريحة من الحياة"],"cast":["Yamada Eiko","Han Keiko"],"director":["Kusuba Kouzou"],"imdbRating":"6.7","runtime":"26 min","videos":[{"id":"cee:1019570","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 1","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/47026027-7B01-4412-1CBF-E9CD6E89C896_poster.jpg","released":"1983-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:1019573","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 2","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/066D5646-E5B6-D316-E9AF-1CDF67FFF40A_poster.jpg","released":"1983-01-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:1019576","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 3","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/066D5646-E5B6-D316-E9AF-1CDF67FFF40A_poster.jpg","released":"1983-01-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:1019579","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 4","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/066D5646-E5B6-D316-E9AF-1CDF67FFF40A_poster.jpg","released":"1983-01-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:1019582","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 5","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/066D5646-E5B6-D316-E9AF-1CDF67FFF40A_poster.jpg","released":"1983-01-05T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:1019585","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 6","season":1,"episode":6,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/va